`comment("Telemetry profiling used before building detections")`
`comment("1) Which hosts are sending data?")`
index=* host=* | stats count by host

`comment("2) Which sourcetypes does the endpoint send?")`
index=* host="DESKTOP-4AMTH10" | stats count by sourcetype

`comment("3) Which Windows Security Event IDs are present?")`
index=* host="DESKTOP-4AMTH10" sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security"
| stats count by EventCode
| sort - count
